    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "McGuirk Beggan Property is delighted to present this bright and well-appointed one-bedroom apartment, discreetly positioned within a private enclave adjacent to Milltown Village. Situated in the highly sought-after Milltown Hill development, this attractive residence enjoys a peaceful setting while being just moments from an excellent range of local shops, cafés, restaurants, and everyday amenities.\n\nExtending to approximately 41 sq.m. (442 sq.ft.), the accommodation has been thoughtfully designed to maximise both space and natural light. The contemporary kitchen features sleek high-gloss cabinetry, integrated appliances, and a convenient breakfast bar, creating an inviting space for casual dining. The kitchen flows seamlessly into the spacious living room, which is bathed in natural light from a large picture window and further enhanced by a feature fireplace and attractive laminate timber flooring.\n\nThe double bedroom benefits from built-in wardrobes and matching laminate timber flooring, while the recently upgraded bathroom is finished to a high standard with stylish tiling, a large walk-in shower, WC, and wash hand basin.\n\nExternally, residents can enjoy beautifully maintained communal gardens and the convenience of designated parking, together with ample visitor parking spaces.\n\n\nMilltown Hill enjoys an enviable location within walking distance of Milltown Village and its excellent local amenities. The vibrant villages of Ranelagh and Donnybrook are also close by, offering an exceptional selection of boutique shops, cafés, restaurants, and bars. The area is particularly well served by some of Dublin`s most respected primary and secondary schools, including Alexandra College, Sandford Park School, Gonzaga College, Muckross Park College, Ranelagh Multi-Denominational School, and Scoil Bhríde.\n\nFor outdoor and leisure enthusiasts, Milltown Golf Club and the scenic Dodder Linear Park are nearby, offering excellent recreational opportunities and picturesque riverside walks connecting Donnybrook, Terenure, and beyond. The property also benefits from superb transport links, with the LUAS and several Dublin Bus routes providing quick and convenient access to Dublin City Centre.\n\nCombining contemporary interiors, excellent natural light, designated parking, and a prime residential location, this exceptional apartment is sure to appeal to a wide range of purchasers.\n\nEarly viewing is highly recommended."
      },
